<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flores &amp; Rucks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flores &amp; Rucks started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Flores &amp; Rucks Inc as a buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- Smith Barney later said it set a 12-month price target of $65 a share.</p>
<p>-- Smith Barney said it expects Flores &amp; Rucks to see $8.50 in cash flow per share in 1997 and $11.40 in cash flow per share in 1998.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
